{
  "title": "Since Tuesday",
  "hook_type": "warning",
  "cards": [
    {
      "text": "Don't open the door when your dog scratches.",
      "scene": "door",
      "photo": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1614670151727-d2829b6551e7?ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=85&fm=jpg&crop=entropy&cs=srgb",
      "photo_id": "_iwlyEBW4lg",
      "photo_credit": "Zane Winter"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mine was asleep on my bed when the scratching started at the back door.",
      "scene": "house",
      "photo": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1609784914557-b995342c4edb?ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=85&fm=jpg&crop=entropy&cs=srgb",
      "photo_id": "9GgsZdW92m8",
      "photo_credit": "Celyn Bowen"
    },
    {
      "text": "Then came her whine, the exact one she makes when she's shut outside.",
      "scene": "hallway",
      "photo": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1695758987304-694fdcb654fa?ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=85&fm=jpg&crop=entropy&cs=srgb",
      "photo_id": "mCBOcFHQhbc",
      "photo_credit": "Samarth Kulkarni"
    },
    {
      "text": "On the bed, she didn't even lift her head.",
      "scene": "house",
      "photo": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1708798358558-87bb71f31246?ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=85&fm=jpg&crop=entropy&cs=srgb",
      "photo_id": "M0ueUMAU9pc",
      "photo_credit": "Louis-Philippe Poitras"
    },
    {
      "text": "She hasn't made a sound since she came home from the woods on Tuesday.",
      "scene": "forest",
      "photo": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1641667838410-b257ca266e38?ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=85&fm=jpg&crop=entropy&cs=srgb",
      "photo_id": "reoc0yCf67c",
      "photo_credit": "Marvin Zettl"
    },
    {
      "text": "The scratching moved to my window, frantic, and the glass fogged with breath.",
      "scene": "window",
      "photo": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1729503019194-f3b46167904a?ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=85&fm=jpg&crop=entropy&cs=srgb",
      "photo_id": "5fqRQdkpNaw",
      "photo_credit": "Studio Pizza"
    },
    {
      "text": "I pulled back the curtain. My dog was outside, shivering, her collar gone.",
      "scene": "forest",
      "photo": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1789451589093-9830dfb23cf4?ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=85&fm=jpg&crop=entropy&cs=srgb",
      "photo_id": "DkdK7tXLZJo",
      "photo_credit": "Filip Mavrodiev"
    },
    {
      "text": "Behind me, I heard the soft jingle of her tag.",
      "scene": "house",
      "photo": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1732115970816-9c3f2aa14f74?ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=85&fm=jpg&crop=entropy&cs=srgb",
      "photo_id": "xRjXFJmWlbA",
      "photo_credit": "Thomas Heath"
    },
    {
      "text": "It's been wearing her collar since Tuesday.",
      "scene": "dark",
      "photo": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1638812279533-646f25ce9474?ixlib=rb-4.1.0&q=85&fm=jpg&crop=entropy&cs=srgb",
      "photo_id": "-KEdIYpaHhY",
      "photo_credit": "Sanne Hartogh"
    }
